\newlabel{TransitTime}{{2}{2}{\textbf {Participant stats.} 20 healthy subjects participated in the study. (A) Sex distribution: 10 female and 10 male. (B) Age distribution: range of 22–46 years, mean 31.3 years. (C) Race: The cohort was predominantly Asian}{figure.caption.3}{}}
