\newlabel{AllTransit}{{5}{4}{\textbf {Summary transit time.} Histogram of transit times in hours of all CapScan devices ingested during the study. Missing devices were not included. Transit times ranged from 12.17--130.97 h (mean 51.9 h = 2.16 days)}{figure.caption.6}{}}
